      "not a number. Nothing is taken: the line stays free until",
      "interrupt_create.",
      "|source| must not be 0xFFFFFFFF, which the kernel keeps as no source",
      "at all (InvArgs, checked before the resource). NoResource if no line",
      "was made for |source|: no pin has that number, or its pin is past",
      "the interrupt vectors the platform has. AccessDenied, once the",
      "resource has been accepted, if the line made for |source| is one the",
      "kernel holds for its own use (the timer's): no program can take it, so",
      "its number is not given, and the caller learns that here and not from",
      "a later interrupt_create. |out| is written only when the call",
      "succeeds; one that cannot be written answers InvArgs, and nothing is",
      "taken then either.",
    ]
    args = [
      {
        name = "resource"
        type = "Uandle"
      },
      {
        name = "source"
        type = "u32"
